        "en": "From him, from his father, from Hariz, from Sinan, from Abu Abdillah (peace be upon him) who said: The Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him and his family) said: 'Verily, when Allah, the Exalted, created Adam (peace be upon him), He looked at him, and he was in his loins.'"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "فَقَالَ: «يَا رَبِّ، هَلْ مِنْ نَسْلِكَ فِي هَذَا الْخَلْقِ أَحَدٌ؟» قَالَ: «نَعَمْ، مِنْهُ نَبِيٌّ وَصِدِّيقٌ وَشُهَدَاءُ وَأَنْبِيَاءُ»",
      "translations": {
        "en": "He said: 'O Lord, is there anyone from his offspring among this creation?' He said: 'Yes, from him [will come] a Prophet, a truthful one, martyrs, and prophets.'"
      }
    },
    {
      "chunk_type": "body",
      "arabic_text": "فَقَالَ: «فَمَنْ هُمْ؟» قَالَ: «مُحَمَّدٌ صَلَّى اللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَآلِهِ وَسَلَّمَ وَأَهْلُهُ»",
      "translations": {
        "en": "He said: 'Who are they?' He said: 'Muhammad (peace be upon him and his family) and his family.'"
      }
    },
